        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Briana Corrigan, Dave Hemingway\n- Songs: \"A Little Time\"\n- Albums: Choke\n- Bands: The South\n- Topics: chart performance, vocal performances\n\nFacts:\n- Briana Corrigan was born on 30 May 1965 and is a Northern Irish singer.\n- The song \"A Little Time\" consists of a duet featuring vocalists Dave Hemingway and Briana Corrigan.\n- \"A Little Time\" was The South's first and only number 1 single.\n- The release of \"A Little Time\" pushed the album Choke to number 2 in the charts.",
